<!--Interaction End -->

</note>
<section class="check-understanding"><title>Check Your Understanding</title><exercise id="d195dacc-9ba7-4549-9592-a1cf623a1447" class="multiple-choice"><problem><para>Which expression is equivalent to \(y^6\)?</para><para>Multiple Choice:</para><para>\(y^2 \cdot y^3\)</para><para>\(y \cdot y^6\)</para><para>\(\frac {y^{12}}{y^2}\)</para><para>\(\frac {y^{12}}{y^6}\)</para></problem><solution><para>Try again. Take a moment to think about what you learned in the mini-lesson review.</para></solution></exercise></section><para>Watch the following videos to learn more about simplifying expressions with exponents.</para>
